{
  "_doc": "Index of the fixtures. `def` is the name in telemetry.schema.json \"$defs\" the file validates against (each: true = array of def). valid=false files MUST be rejected by the schema. kind: wire-server / wire-client = a WebSocket JSON message (also valid against the schema root); derived = computed by the client; http / file = other.",
